<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">Lil Uzi Vert</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Symere Woods</songwriter><songwriter>Bryan Lammar Simmons</songwriter><songwriter>Gregory Lamar Davis</songwriter><songwriter>Sidney Tapaquon Malabre</songwriter><songwriter>Kenneth Smith Jr.</songwriter><songwriter>Isaac John DeBoni</songwriter><songwriter>Michael John Mule</songwriter><songwriter>Noah Yoo</songwriter><songwriter>Sedon Corinn Schat</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">月色真美啊 对你的爱意说不出口</text><text for="L2">Woah woah</text><text for="L3">Woah woah</text><text for="L4">Woah woah woah</text><text for="L5">Woah woah woah</text><text for="L6">Woah</text><text for="L7">今晚我看到了红色的月亮</text><text for="L8">毁灭 灾难</text><text for="L9">我想和你在一起 直到我们死去</text><text for="L10">我对自己说 我可以改变这一切</text><text for="L11">我可以改变</text><text for="L12">提醒自己不要抱怨</text><text for="L13">不要抱怨</text><text for="L14">但我们的爱不同往日</text><text for="L15">Woah</text><text for="L16">但我们的爱不同往日</text><text for="L17">我们的感情随四季更易</text><text for="L18">你对我说 你要离开了</text><text for="L19">你毫不留恋地走了 我无法呼吸</text><text for="L20">我忍不住一直思念她</text><text for="L21">一定是眼盲了 不然我怎么看不见那些蛛丝马迹</text><text for="L22">闭眼</text><text for="L23">她说 别哭了 你要学会适应</text><text for="L24">根本不一样了</text><text for="L25">我们的爱不同往日</text><text for="L26">我们的感情随四季更易</text><text for="L27">你对我说 你要离开了</text><text for="L28">你毫不留恋地走了 我</text><text for="L29">迷失了自我 收拾弄乱的房间</text><text for="L30">不知所措 脑子里思绪纷飞</text><text for="L31">Yeah</text><text for="L32">想着我夭亡的爱情</text><text for="L33">Woah</text><text for="L34">未能从他们身上得到的</text><text for="L35">我发誓一定要从你身上找寻到</text><text for="L36">你</text><text for="L37">你放开了我的手 我沮丧不已</text><text for="L38">我孤零零的 盯着红色月亮</text><text for="L39">独自一人 双眼放空</text><text for="L40">请你</text><text for="L41">看看</text><text for="L42">请你</text><text for="L43">Woah</text><text for="L44">看看我的心碎</text><text for="L45">Yeah</text><text for="L46">Yeah</text><text for="L47">Yeah</text><text for="L48">Yeah</text><text for="L49">Yeah</text><text for="L50">Oh oh</text><text for="L51">我们的爱不同往日</text><text for="L52">我们的爱不同往日</text><text for="L53">我们的感情随四季更易</text><text for="L54">你对我说 你要离开了</text><text for="L55">你毫不留恋地走了 我无法呼吸</text><text for="L56">我们的爱不同往日</text><text for="L57">我们的爱不同往日</text><text for="L58">我们的感情随四季更易</text><text for="L59">你对我说 你要离开了</text><text for="L60">你毫不留恋地走了 我无法呼吸</text><text for="L61">我忍不住一直思念她</text><text for="L62">一定是眼盲了 不然我怎么看不见那些蛛丝马迹</text><text for="L63">她说 不要哭了 你要学会适应</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:07.971" end="0:10.042" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.971" end="0:08.122">I</span> <span begin="0:08.122" end="0:08.267">watch</span> <span begin="0:08.267" end="0:08.426">the</span> <span begin="0:08.426" end="0:08.458">moon</span> <span begin="0:08.458" end="0:08.658">all</span> <span begin="0:08.658" end="0:08.811">the</span> <span begin="0:08.811" end="0:09.002">time</span> <span begin="0:09.002" end="0:09.291">thinkin'</span> <span begin="0:09.291" end="0:09.570">about</span> <span begin="0:09.570" end="0:10.042">you</span></p><p begin="0:14.433" end="0:15.825" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.433" end="0:15.048">Woah</span> <span begin="0:15.048" end="0:15.825">woah</span></p><p begin="0:17.680" end="0:20.002" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.680" end="0:18.200">Woah</span> <span begin="0:18.200" end="0:20.002">woah</span></p><p begin="0:20.358" end="0:21.339" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"